<section class="container" style="padding-block:1rem 4rem;max-width:760px;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">How the four fit together</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The order is not an outline but a sequence. <strong>Thinking from the end</strong> clarifies what the work is aiming at. <strong>Concept before execution</strong> decides what is done to get there and what is left out. <strong>Placement in the market</strong> determines where the brand should stand and whether that position is robust. <strong>Credibility and persuasive power</strong> is the yardstick against which every result is tested — and the reason some things that looked good are dropped.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The result is not a catalogue of services but a chain of decisions that can be traced backwards. That is the difference from a presence that is merely liked: you can disagree with it — with arguments, not with taste.</p>
</section>

